BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Woodstockers TV Pilot + Talk-Back about the rise of Indie TV 🔴
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261014T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261014T193000
DTSTAMP:20260921T135154Z
UID:6a95b567c1445f8f5e65a065@woodstockfilmfestival.org
DESCRIPTION:Following the premiere of the pilot for the new indie series W
 oodstockers\, join the filmmakers – Corbin Bernsen (star\, co-writer\, e
 xecutive producer)\, Henry Bernsen (co-writer) and Zoe Rosenberg (producer
 ) and creative team for a lively conversation and Q&A about the making of 
 the project\, the unique experience of filming in the Hudson Valley\, the 
 future of the series\, and what it means to create television independentl
 y.\n\nThe discussion will cover how development\, production and distribut
 ion look different in this new frontier and how a direct relationship betw
 een creator and audience\, built on open communication\, helps shape the e
 ntire process. There’s perhaps no more fitting place to have this conver
 sation than Woodstock itself.\n\nThis event is free\, courtesy of Stoned A
 gain LLC.\n\n🔴 Sold out as of Fri\, Sep 18 2026 at 2:51 PM \n\n🔗 htt
 ps://woodstockfilmfestival.org/2026-all-events?eventId=6a95b567c1445f8f5e6
 5a065
LOCATION:Tinker Street Cinema\, 132 Tinker Street\, Woodstock\, NY 12498
URL:https://woodstockfilmfestival.org/2026-all-events?eventId=6a95b567c144
 5f8f5e65a065
X-WFF-SOLDOUT:2026-09-18T14:51:04.910757-04:00
END:VEVENT
