SUMMARY:MASTERCLASS WITH CATHERINE HARDWICKE: FIX IT IN PREP 🎟️
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T133000
DTSTAMP:20260917T215057Z
UID:6aa1bb66f557af72f6cf64fc@woodstockfilmfestival.org
DESCRIPTION:Catherine Hardwicke’s master class “Fix it in Prep” take
 s you through her process preparing for her films includingThirteen\,Lords
  of DogtownandTwilight– as well as TV shows including Netflix’s Guille
 rmo del Toro’sCabinet of Curiosities– “Dreams in the Witchhouse” 
 (working with Oscar® winning creature and production designers). She deta
 ils her prep journey with clips\, storyboards\, shot lists\, shooting diag
 rams\, and behind the scenes rehearsals. She explains how she works with c
 ostume designers\, production designers\, and cinematographers to find a v
 isual language for each film. She’s presented the workshop at USC\, NYU
 \, Design Center\, Sundance Labs (where she’s been an advisor for 11 sum
 mer labs)\, and multiple film festivals including Tribeca\, TIFF\, VIFF\, 
 London Screenwriter’s Festival\, and the Rio de Janeiro Film Festival.\n
 \nCatherine Hardwickedirected the acclaimedThirteen\, cult-classicLords of
  Dogtown\, and blockbusterTwilight- launching a $3.3 billion franchise. He
 r latest film\,Street Smart\, explores young creatives surviving on Venice
  Beach.\n\n🎟️ Tickets Available\n\n🔗 https://woodstockfilmfestival
 .org/2026-all-events?eventId=6aa1bb66f557af72f6cf64fc
LOCATION:Utopia Studios\, 293 Tinker Street\, Woodstock\, NY 12498
URL:https://woodstockfilmfestival.org/2026-all-events?eventId=6aa1bb66f557
 af72f6cf64fc
