SUMMARY:In Hines Sight 🎟️
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T171500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T191500
DTSTAMP:20260916T171252Z
UID:6aa86c8f153010043a37972e@woodstockfilmfestival.org
DESCRIPTION:Some years ago a Connecticut maintenance worker Jared Whipple 
 (the film’s co-director) was called in on a job to empty out a local bar
 n. Inside was artist Francis Hines’ lifetime of work\, all of which was 
 about to be destroyed.In Hines Sightreveals the 9-year ride that is the un
 folding of Hines’ story. – Adam Schartoff\n\n🎟️ Tickets Available
