SUMMARY:Danny Is My Boyfriend 🎟️
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T191500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T211500
DTSTAMP:20260916T171252Z
UID:6aa86c8f153010043a379714@woodstockfilmfestival.org
DESCRIPTION:Tightly-wound Lucy has moved back in with her mother after a b
 reakup so bad it landed her in a psych ward. So when her new boyfriend Dan
 ny asks her to dogsit while he’s away for his nephew’s non-denominatio
 nal circumcision party\, it feels like proof she’s back on track. Until 
 a stranger recognizes the three-legged dog… as HER boyfriend’s dog. Th
 rown into a reluctant alliance by the discovery that they’re both dating
  Danny\, Lucy and the stranger—Mechi\, a socially awkward babysitter—c
 onspire to get even. Fully improvised\, the film is driven by its digressi
 ons and misfires\, which build into an absurdist comedy of errors that’s
  funny\, tender\, and resists expectation.\n\nDue to limited seating capac
 ity of this 42-seat theater\, passholders must RSVP by choosing “Order T
 ickets.”\n\n🎟️ Tickets Available\n\n🔗 https://woodstockfilmfesti
 val.org/2026-all-events?eventId=6aa86c8f153010043a379714
LOCATION:Upstate Midtown\, 591 Broadway\, Kingston\, NY 12401
URL:https://woodstockfilmfestival.org/2026-all-events?eventId=6aa86c8f1530
 10043a379714
END:VEVENT
